      "description": "Translucent paper plaque carrying the logo at the top right of the sea.",
      "html": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(162deg,#46cfd9,#1a9cc2);padding:24px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start\"><div class=\"ds-logo\">ربيع القلوب</div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--sea-shallow:#46cfd9;--ink:#062a3b;--ink-2:#0a3a50;--gold:#ffd25c;--gold-hot:#ffb627;--sand:#f2d28b;--paper:#fff8e8;--coral:#ff5d4f;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--font-display:\"Baloo Bhaijaan 2\",\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;--font-body:\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;} .ds-logo{width:140px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:22px;background:rgba(255,248,232,0.92);box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(3,30,55,0.35),inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(201,151,74,0.5);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:22px;text-align:center}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "icon-button",
      "description": "Fullscreen and settings controls floating at the bottom right of the sea, 0.55 opacity until hover or focus.",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:#0b6e88;padding:20px\"><div class=\"ds-controls\"><button class=\"ds-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"ملء الشاشة\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon-btn\" aria-label=\"الإعدادات\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--sea-shallow:#46cfd9;--ink:#062a3b;--ink-2:#0a3a50;--gold:#ffd25c;--gold-hot:#ffb627;--sand:#f2d28b;--paper:#fff8e8;--coral:#ff5d4f;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--font-display:\"Baloo Bhaijaan 2\",\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;--font-body:\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;} .ds-icon-btn{width:46px;height:46px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:14px;border:0;background:rgba(6,42,59,0.6);color:var(--sand);cursor:pointer;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(242,210,139,0.28);transition:background 160ms ease,transform 160ms var(--ease-out),color 160ms ease}.ds-icon-btn:hover{background:rgba(242,210,139,0.16);color:#fff}.ds-icon-btn:active{transform:scale(0.94)}.ds-icon-btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}.ds-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;opacity:0.55;transition:opacity 200ms ease}.ds-controls:hover,.ds-controls:focus-within{opacity:1}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Move Ships Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "move-button",
      "description": "The single gold call to action that sets the ships sailing.",
      "html": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:#0b6e88;padding:32px\"><button class=\"ds-move-btn\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M12 7.2V21M8 11h8M4 14c0 4 3.6 7 8 7s8-3 8-7\"/></svg>تحريك السفن</button></div>",
      "css": ":host{--sea-shallow:#46cfd9;--ink:#062a3b;--ink-2:#0a3a50;--gold:#ffd25c;--gold-hot:#ffb627;--sand:#f2d28b;--paper:#fff8e8;--coral:#ff5d4f;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--font-display:\"Baloo Bhaijaan 2\",\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;--font-body:\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;} .ds-move-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0.55em 1.5em 0.65em;border:0;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:26px;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffe08a,var(--gold-hot));box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(150,95,10,0.55),0 16px 34px rgba(3,30,55,0.5);cursor:pointer;transition:transform 160ms var(--ease-out),box-shadow 160ms var(--ease-out)}.ds-move-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 9px 18px rgba(150,95,10,0.55),0 20px 40px rgba(3,30,55,0.5)}.ds-move-btn:active{transform:translateY(4px);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(150,95,10,0.55),0 10px 20px rgba(3,30,55,0.5)}.ds-move-btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Arrival Banner",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "arrival-banner",
      "description": "Ink pill with a class-colour ring announcing an island arrival.",
      "html": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:#1a9cc2;padding:32px\"><div class=\"ds-arrival\" style=\"--team:#22C55E\">فصل 3 وصل <em>جزيرة التحدي</em></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--sea-shallow:#46cfd9;--ink:#062a3b;--ink-2:#0a3a50;--gold:#ffd25c;--gold-hot:#ffb627;--sand:#f2d28b;--paper:#fff8e8;--coral:#ff5d4f;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--font-display:\"Baloo Bhaijaan 2\",\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;--font-body:\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;} .ds-arrival{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.6em;padding:0.35em 1.1em 0.45em;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--team),0 0 0 8px rgba(6,42,59,0.6),0 24px 50px rgba(2,20,32,0.55)}.ds-arrival em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Announcement Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "announcement-card",
      "description": "Full-room reveal of one student's points, in their class colour.",
      "html": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:#02101a;padding:32px\"><div class=\"ds-ann\" style=\"--team:#3B82F6\"><div class=\"ds-ann-name\">اسم الطالب</div><div class=\"ds-ann-pts\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\">+100</bdi><span>نقطة</span></div><span class=\"ds-ann-team\">فصل 1</span></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--sea-shallow:#46cfd9;--ink:#062a3b;--ink-2:#0a3a50;--gold:#ffd25c;--gold-hot:#ffb627;--sand:#f2d28b;--paper:#fff8e8;--coral:#ff5d4f;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--font-display:\"Baloo Bhaijaan 2\",\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;--font-body:\"Tajawal\",sans-serif;} .ds-ann{width:560px;padding:36px 40px 40px;border-radius:40px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(90% 60% at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--team) 38%,transparent),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ink-2),var(--ink));box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--team),0 0 0 11px rgba(6,42,59,0.7),0 40px 90px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}.ds-ann-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:56px;line-height:1.1;color:#fff}.ds-ann-pts{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:0.25em;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:900;font-size:88px;line-height:1;color:var(--gold);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(255,210,92,0.45),0 6px 16px rgba(120,75,10,0.6)}.ds-ann-pts span{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.34em;color:var(--sand);text-shadow:none}.ds-ann-team{display:inline-flex;margin-top:0.5em;padding:0.15em 0.9em 0.22em;border-radius:999px;background:var(--team);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:24px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Living Gulf",
    "overview": "The race board is a sunlit Gulf sea that five classes cross in dhows. Water runs from turquoise shallows in the upper corner down to deep teal and abyss, with wave glints drifting over it, cloud shadows sliding across, and lagoons ringing each island. A sand-gold rope marks the route. Coral-and-cream channel buoys carry big numerals, and each dhow flies a lateen sail in its class color. The sea fills the whole viewport. The logo rides on a cream plaque in the top corner, and two quiet controls float in the bottom corner.\n\nThe world is built for a projector at the back of a room. Everything is set thick, heavy, and large: 800 to 900 weights, fat strokes, pill-shaped labels on dark or sand grounds, and numerals in tabular figures. The race is read from the ships themselves: every dhow carries a tag with its class name and points, and the leader wears a crown. Spectacle (bobbing hulls, a foam wake, buoy lamps lighting, confetti on arrival) serves the reveal but never competes with the standings. The whole surface is Arabic and right-to-left.\n\nDepth comes from water and light rather than cards: gradients, vignettes, blurred drop shadows under the islands and hulls, and soft glows on everything gold. The surface has no flat panels and no hard offset shadows.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Sea gradient, from turquoise shallows to deep-teal abyss, with drifting glint tiles and cloud shadows, filling the full viewport",
      "Sand-gold rope route, with the leader's travelled stretch gilded and flowing",
      "Authored SVG world objects (dhow, buoy, crown, sail chip, coin) instead of emoji or icon fonts",
      "Heavy rounded Arabic display type (Baloo Bhaijaan 2) over a Tajawal workhorse, with tabular numerals throughout",
      "Pills for every label that floats over water",
      "Ships that would overlap sail in an echelon formation, so no class is ever hidden",
      "Motion runs on transforms only and has a full reduced-motion path"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Gold Means Earned Rule",
        "body": "Gold (treasure, wake, hot) marks only points, the leader, lit progress, and the one call to action. Do not use gold as decoration.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Class Owns Its Sail Rule",
        "body": "Class color lives on canvas and labels (sail, pennant, gunwale band, tag, banner ring) and never on the sea or the route.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Voices Rule",
        "body": "Names in Baloo, numbers in Tajawal with tabular figures. A score never sets in the display face.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Back-Row Rule",
        "body": "No board text is lighter than 800 weight. Running text on the board does not exist.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Water Casts Soft Rule",
        "body": "Every shadow on the board is blurred and tinted toward deep sea navy. Gold things glow instead of casting hard edges.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do draw the route as a thick rope (rope with rope-dark twists) over a soft lagoon channel, and gild only the leader's travelled stretch with the wake-gold core, wake-amber twist, and blurred glow.",
      "Do size everything from the board factor `k` so the map holds together from 1366 to 1920 and beyond.",
      "Do set names in Baloo Bhaijaan 2 at 800 and every number in Tajawal with tabular figures.",
      "Do put labels that float over water in pills with the label-float shadow.",
      "Do resolve overlapping ships with the echelon formation and keep every group inside the board, so every hull, sail, and tag stays visible.",
      "Do animate only transform and opacity, and give every looping animation an off switch under prefers-reduced-motion. Confetti is removed entirely.",
      "Do draw world objects as authored SVG with round joins and wood or ink outlines."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't draw the route as a thin dashed line on a flat gradient. Dashes belong only inside the rope's twist and the wake lines.",
      "Don't use emoji or icon-font glyphs as markers. Buoys, ships, crowns, and coins are drawn.",
      "Don't use hard, unblurred offset shadows on the board.",
      "Don't use tiny floating labels. Values on the map come in pills scaled from `k`, the buoy size, or the ship width, never below the 56px buoy floor or the 15px ship-tag floor.",
      "Don't fill a hull with a class color, or put class color on the sea or the route.",
      "Don't spend gold on decoration."
    ]
  }
}
